  "body": "Step into a world of contemporary comfort and effortless living! Completed in 2025, this beautifully presented home combines stylish design, practical functionality and an easy-care lifestyle in the sought-after Half Moon Bay neighbourhood.\r\n\r\nWhether you're a growing family, a busy professional or simply looking for a modern home with minimal maintenance, this inviting residence offers the perfect place to call home.\r\n\r\nDesigned for Comfort, Created for Living\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you step inside, you'll appreciate the bright, welcoming interiors and thoughtfully arranged living spaces.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, a stylish open-plan kitchen and dining area brings everyone together. Featuring quality appliances, a gas cooktop, wall oven and dishwasher, it's the\r\nperfect setting for preparing family meals or entertaining friends.\r\n\r\nThe separate lounge provides a peaceful retreat where you can unwind after a busy day, enjoy movie nights or simply relax with loved ones.\r\n\r\nFour generously sized bedrooms offer comfortable accommodation for the whole family, including a master bedroom with its own ensuite. Two well-appointed bathrooms and two separate WCs provide additional convenience for everyday living.\r\n\r\nStep outside to discover a welcoming deck and patio area, ideal for weekend barbecues, morning coffee or relaxing in the sunshine. The easy-care outdoor space allows you to spend less time on maintenance and more time enjoying life.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n*  Completed in 2025 - Modern design and stylish finishes\r\n*  4 Spacious Bedrooms - Including a master with ensuite\r\n*  2 Bathrooms + 2 Separate WCs - Convenience for busy families\r\n*  Modern Kitchen - Gas cooktop, wall oven and dishwasher\r\n*  Open-Plan Kitchen & Dining - Ideal for everyday living\r\n*  Separate Lounge - Additional space to relax and entertain\r\n*  Outdoor Deck & Patio - Perfect for outdoor enjoyment\r\n*  Internal-Access Garage - With automatic garage door\r\n*  Heat Pump & Insulation - Comfort throughout the seasons\r\n*  197m² Land Area (More or Less) - Easy-care living\r\n\r\nEnjoy the Best of Half Moon Bay!\r\nPositioned in a popular and established neighbourhood, this home places everyday\r\nconveniences within easy reach.\r\n\r\nEnjoy nearby shopping centres, local schools, parks and public transport, while the vibrant Half Moon Bay Marina, waterfront restaurants and ferry services offer wonderful\r\nopportunities for leisure and commuting.\r\n\r\nWith its appealing location and modern comforts, this home delivers a lifestyle that is both convenient and enjoyable.\r\n \r\nContact Harley Hou 0212780830 or Marilyn Hong Ma 0210474498 today to arrange a private viewing or visit our next open home!",
